# Store every text file with LF line endings, whatever the author's OS (core.autocrlf=true on
# Windows still checks them out as CRLF). A CRLF blob makes `git diff --check` report every line
# as trailing whitespace, which failed diff-based gates after a merge.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.go text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
